// The dag-team half is the upstream @nanmicoder/dsh-agent-teams 0.1.21 source
// tree, ported verbatim (see docs/development-plan.md §D1). Its own tsconfig
// enables `strict` but NOT `exactOptionalPropertyTypes`, which this repository's
// Harness-derived facade does turn on. Under that extra flag several upstream
// call sites stop compiling (TS2375/TS2379, "Type 'X | undefined' is not
// assignable to type 'X'") purely because upstream writes
// `{ memberModel: maybeUndefined }` where the facade wants the key omitted.
//
// Upstream is therefore compiled under its own strictness level here, so the
// ported tree stays byte-identical and stays cheap to diff against the next
// upstream release. Relaxing the flag is type-check only: emitted JavaScript and
// the published .d.ts of this package are unaffected.
{
  "extends": "../../tsconfig.types.json",
  "include": ["src"],
  "compilerOptions": {
    "exactOptionalPropertyTypes": false
  }
}
